  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Banana Tree.png|200px|left|Banana tree]]\n\n{{Infobox\n|level = 88\n|price = 800\n|gives = {{Infoicon|banana|big|link=Banana}}\n|time = every 1 d 4 h\n|xp = 20\n|dia = 17\n|title = [[Trees and Bushes|Trees & bushes]]\n}}\n'''Banana trees''' are a type of [[Trees and Bushes|tree]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 88.\n\nThey can be harvested four times for [[banana]]s, which are stored in the [[Silo]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Stages'''===\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Banana_Tree_Stage_1.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Banana_Tree_Stage_2.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Banana_Tree_Stage_3.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Banana_Tree_Stage_4.png|100px]]\n|-\n|'''Stage 1'''\n|'''Stage 2'''\n|'''Ready'''\n|'''Dead'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Buying'''===\n{{Infoicon|shop|bigger|link=Shop}} Banana trees can be purchased in the [[shop]] for 800 [[coin]]s each.\n----\n==='''Harvesting'''===\nThe growth cycle (time between harvests) is 1 day and 4 hours for each tree. Each harvest yields additional bananas:\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Banana_Tree_Stage_3.png|150px]]\n|[[File:Banana_Tree_Harvest_3.png|150px]]\n|[[File:Banana Tree.png|150px]]\n|-\n|'''2 bananas'''\n|'''3 bananas'''\n|'''4 bananas'''\n|}\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Revival'''===\n{{NoPic}}\nAfter the third harvest the tree wilts. A player can ask for another player to revive it by tapping on it and placing a sign on the tree. The helper gets 20 {{Infoicon|xp}} points by reviving a banana tree.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Removing'''===\n[[File:Saw.png|150px|left|A saw]]\nA [[saw]] is needed to remove a dead tree. Note that players may also use a saw to remove the tree after the third harvest instead of placing it up for revival.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Bananenstaude\n|es = Platanero\n|fr = Bananier\n|it = Banano\n|no = Banantre\n|ru = Банановое дерево\n}}\n[[Category:Trees and Bushes]]",
  "wikitextHash": "6713230cfe1b47e5bcbbc9b4f7b63913f409b462c500d4ebbf9b0ba5fede988d"
